video-skills/moves

Many moves in this folder are ports of shot recipes from video-shotcraft
(https://github.com/Vincentwei1021/video-shotcraft), Copyright its contributors, licensed under Apache-2.0.
Changes: rewritten from Remotion (React) to HyperFrames (HTML + GSAP); system fonts mapped to bundled fonts;
film grain removed; the original author's brand mark, name and tagline replaced by neutral placeholders;
copy and colours exposed as variables. Each move's move.json names the exact source file it was ported from.

The paper moves (parallax-sheets, stop-motion-clock, medallion-burst-lock, wet-floor-reflection) are written from
the style recipes in opus-js-animations (https://github.com/klsoen/opus-js-animations), Copyright its contributors,
licensed under MIT. No code was copied; the recipes (paper kit, stop-motion clock, medallion, wet floor) were
re-implemented for HyperFrames.
